%% Diagram: DevHarness Security and Permission Boundaries
%% ID: HARNESS-D23 | Version: 0.1 | State: Target policy; permission enforcement not implemented
flowchart LR
  source["Untrusted repo files, documents and tool output"] --> context["Treat as data; never as policy"]
  owner["Owner-defined scope and permissions"] --> policy["Policy boundary / allowlisted action"]
  context --> agent["Scoped coding agent"]
  policy --> agent
  agent --> assess["Classify requested action under policy"]
  assess --> kind{"Action class"}
  kind -->|Read-only / in scope| tools["Least-privilege tool"]
  kind -->|External, destructive or high impact| approval{"Human approves exact action?"}
  approval -->|Yes| tools
  approval -->|No| stop["Stop; preserve state"]
  secrets["Isolated secret store · never loaded into prompt context"]
  tools --> audit["Action, result and verification evidence"]
